{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-06-12T14:16:54.549Z","tool_name":"replace","tool_id":"replace__cdk0dhix","parameters":{"old_string":"    // spec: §13.2.6.4.1 The \"initial\" insertion mode\n    fn handle_initial(&mut self, token: Token) {\n        match token {\n            Token::Character(c) if is_html_whitespace(c) => {\n                // Ignore the token.\n            }\n            Token::Comment(data) => {\n                let node = self.dom.create_node(NodeData::Comment(data));\n                self.dom.append_child(self.dom.document(), node);\n            }\n            Token::Doctype {\n                name,\n                public_id,\n                system_id,\n                force_quirks: _,\n            } => {\n                // TODO(spec): handle quirks mode\n                let node = self.dom.create_node(NodeData::Doctype {\n                    name: name.unwrap_or_default(),\n                    public_id: public_id.unwrap_or_default(),\n                    system_id: system_id.unwrap_or_default(),\n                });\n                self.dom.append_child(self.dom.document(), node);\n                self.insertion_mode = InsertionMode::BeforeHtml;\n            }\n            _ => {\n                self.insertion_mode = InsertionMode::BeforeHtml;\n                self.process_token(token);\n            }\n        }\n    }","instruction":"Update handle_initial to calculate and store quirks_mode from Doctype token, or fallback to QuirksMode::Quirks on any other token.","allow_multiple":false,"new_string":"    // spec: §13.2.6.4.1 The \"initial\" insertion mode\n    fn handle_initial(&mut self, token: Token) {\n        match token {\n            Token::Character(c) if is_html_whitespace(c) => {\n                // Ignore the token.\n            }\n            Token::Comment(data) => {\n                let node = self.dom.create_node(NodeData::Comment(data));\n                self.dom.append_child(self.dom.document(), node);\n            }\n            Token::Doctype {\n                name,\n                public_id,\n                system_id,\n                force_quirks,\n            } => {\n                // TODO(spec): surface quirks_mode onto the Document node / Dom once a dom-side field exists\n                self.quirks_mode = quirks_mode_for_doctype(\n                    name.as_deref(),\n                    public_id.as_deref(),\n                    system_id.as_deref(),\n                    force_quirks,\n                );\n                let node = self.dom.create_node(NodeData::Doctype {\n                    name: name.unwrap_or_default(),\n                    public_id: public_id.unwrap_or_default(),\n                    system_id: system_id.unwrap_or_default(),\n                });\n                self.dom.append_child(self.dom.document(), node);\n                self.insertion_mode = InsertionMode::BeforeHtml;\n            }\n            _ => {\n                // TODO(spec): surface quirks_mode onto the Document node / Dom once a dom-side field exists\n                self.quirks_mode = QuirksMode::Quirks;\n                self.insertion_mode = InsertionMode::BeforeHtml;\n                self.process_token(token);\n            }\n        }\n    }","file_path":"src/html/tree.rs"}}
